2027-01-04T13:43:35  reasoning Reasoned (2543 chars).
The owner wants a five-minute stretching routine for a sore neck. I should just write it well. Let me give a practical, safe routine. I should note caution: if pain is severe, radiating down arm, numbness, etc., see a doctor.

